1
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:13,180
Hello and welcome to this MOOC massive open online course on bio risk management.
大家好，欢迎学习这门关于生物风险管理的 MOOC，也就是大规模开放在线课程。

2
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:20,180
Today I have made this video especially for the participants of this particular MOOC.
今天我专门为这门 MOOC 的学员制作了这段视频。

3
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:25,180
So I am wearing what is known as personal protective equipment.
我现在穿着的就是所谓的个人防护装备。

4
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:31,180
So I have a Tyvek suit, I have gloves and as you can see I have taped these gloves to my Tyvek suit
我穿着一套 Tyvek 防护服，戴着手套，大家可以看到，我用胶带把手套和 Tyvek 防护服粘在一起，

5
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:35,180
in order to prevent a breach of containment at this location.
以防止这个部位出现防护失效。

6
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:39,180
Okay, this Tyvek suit is required when you are handling fluids.
好，处理液体时需要穿这种 Tyvek 防护服。

7
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:50,180
Especially in today's example I will be handling body fluids or VTM, viral transport media derived samples.
特别是在今天的示例中，我要处理体液或者 VTM，也就是病毒运输培养基中的样本。

8
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:54,180
So I have to wear this suit in order to protect myself in case of a spill.
所以我必须穿上这套防护服，以便在发生泄漏时保护自己。

9
00:00:54,180 --> 00:01:00,180
As I mentioned earlier in my video on the powered air purified respirator,
正如我之前在关于动力送风过滤式呼吸器的视频中提到的，

10
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:05,180
I have my battery pack over here and I have followed through with the SOP
我的电池组在这里，而且我在穿戴个人防护装备时，

11
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:13,180
which is an administrative control over here when I don't obey my protective equipment EPEs.
已经遵循了标准操作规程，这里的标准操作规程就是一种管理控制。

12
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:15,180
So now we are all set to go.
现在我们一切准备就绪。

13
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:22,180
I am going to zip up this but before that I am going to wear my powered air purified respirator.
我要把这个拉链拉上，但在这之前，我要先戴上动力送风过滤式呼吸器。

14
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:24,180
So I am going to wear my respirator now.
现在我来戴呼吸器。

15
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:28,180
So the respirator goes on top of my head.
呼吸器戴在头顶上。

16
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:32,180
It sits there and I turn on my power.
把它放好，然后打开电源。

17
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:36,620
My power tickles before I seal it.
在密封之前，我先检查一下电源。

18
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:42,620
So the power is now running.
现在电源正在运行。

19
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:44,620
I can see the power running.
我可以看到电源在运行。

20
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:46,620
Then I have to wear my shroud.
然后我要戴上头罩。

21
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:47,620
This is my shroud.
这是我的头罩。

22
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:50,620
So I am going to zip up this.
现在我要把这个拉链拉上。

23
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:54,610
So I put everything in.
把所有东西都塞进去。

24
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:55,610
The wires go in.
电线也塞进去。

25
00:01:55,610 --> 00:01:58,610
And I zip up.
然后拉上拉链。

26
00:02:01,610 --> 00:02:06,080
Now I am going to tie up this respirator.
现在我要把这个呼吸器系紧。

27
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:40,860
See I will do a deep check on my power.
我再快速检查一下电源。

28
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:42,860
So there is a lighting here which I can see.
这里有指示灯，我可以看到。

29
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:44,860
There are three lights.
一共有三个灯。

30
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:53,230
So when they are all lighted up it means I am powered up and ready to go into the laboratory workspace.
当它们全部亮起时，就表示电源已开启，可以进入实验室工作区了。

31
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:58,230
Now as a precaution I have to wear another set of gloves.
作为预防措施，我还要再戴一副手套。

32
00:02:58,230 --> 00:03:00,230
So these are double gloves.
这就是双层手套。

33
00:03:00,230 --> 00:03:06,230
I am going to wear this glove over my glove so that in case of a spill I can discard this glove.
我要把这副手套戴在原来的手套外面，这样一旦发生泄漏，我就可以把这副手套丢掉。

34
00:03:06,230 --> 00:03:08,230
So I am going to wear this glove.
现在我来戴这副手套。

35
00:03:08,230 --> 00:03:26,180
So I have basically a double glove.
这样我基本上就戴上了双层手套。

36
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:36,750
So now in the event of a spill, if I spill, I will take off my glove.
现在，一旦发生泄漏，如果我洒出了东西，就会脱下手套。

37
00:03:36,750 --> 00:03:42,750
And I will replace it with another glove inside my laboratory space.
然后在实验室内换上另一副手套。

38
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:54,130
Now as a final check you need to look into the mirror to check everything is in order.
最后，作为最终检查，你需要照镜子看看一切是否妥当。

39
00:03:54,130 --> 00:03:58,130
And your safety suit is in place.
以及你的防护服是否穿戴到位。

40
00:03:58,130 --> 00:04:07,130
So that is how you basically don't wear personal protective equipment prior to entry into the lab.
这基本上就是进入实验室之前穿戴个人防护装备的方法。

41
00:04:07,130 --> 00:04:09,130
That is about the video.
这段视频就到这里。

42
00:04:09,130 --> 00:04:10,130
Thank you very much for watching.
非常感谢观看。

43
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:12,130
I am going to go in now.
我现在要进去了。

44
00:04:12,130 --> 00:04:13,130
Stay bio safe.
请注意生物安全。
